    "title": "Miami (Ohio) vs SMU First Four game time set for March Madness, Tennessee opponent",
    "text": "MENS BASKETBALLGame time set for First Four, Miami (Ohio) vs SMU, Tennessee next in March Madness Wynton JacksonKnoxville News SentinelMarch 15, 2026, 9:46 p.m. ETTennessee basketball fans will have appointment viewing for the First Four.The Vols (22-11) entered the NCAA Tournament as a No. 6 seed in the Midwest Region. Unlike most other teams, they still don't know their opponent for the first round of March Madness. Miami of Ohio (31-1) and SMU (23-11), two No. 11 seeds, will face off on March 18 (9:15 ET, TruTV) at UD Arena in Dayton, Ohio.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
